WEBVTT

V01-1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.700
Your people and agents see different truths.

V02-2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.000
The truth is scattered across the systems where work happens.

V03-3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.600
People rebuild it by hand.

V03-4
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.800
Agents start without it.

V04-5
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.600
Navis turns those signals into one shared understanding.

V05-6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.000
Every email, meeting, document and message becomes a signal —

V06-7
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.900
remembered, connected, and turned into what should happen next.

V07-8
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.900
Inside a company, the Navis App is for people.

V08-9
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:27.750
It shows what changed —

V08-10
00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.300
Acme's renewal moved.

V09-11
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:30.480
And why:

V09-12
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:34.000
every fact with its source, its time, and how fresh it is.

V10-13
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.300
It's waiting on you, so Navis drafts the reply.

V11-14
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.100
A person decides.

V12-15
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.600
Then the company acts.

V13-16
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
The same company's agents use Navis Developer.

V14-17
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.716
Invite the team.

V14-18
00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.600
Connect once —

V14-19
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.100
MCP, API, SDK or CLI.

V15-20
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.333
The agent asks —

V15-21
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.700
and gets cited facts, with their freshness.

V16-22
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Navis isn't the model.

V16-23
00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:58.700
It supplies the company's truth.

V17-24
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.600
Every request is checked against its permissions.

V18-25
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.400
The agent does the work, and the run is on record.

V19-26
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.521
A solo builder gets a private workspace —

V19-27
00:01:08.521 --> 00:01:11.900
and the work state carries into the next session.

V20-28
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.569
One company.

V20-29
00:01:14.569 --> 00:01:17.300
The person and the agent acted on the same event.

V21-30
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:18.800
Same facts.

V21-31
00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:19.900
Same sources.

V21-32
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:20.900
Same freshness.

V22-33
00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.900
One understanding.

V22-34
00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:23.500
Two ways in.

V23-35
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:25.600
Models change.

V23-36
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.800
Agents change.

V23-37
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.000
Tools change.

V24-38
00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:30.000
What it knows stays yours.

V25-39
00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.400
Company-owned.

V25-40
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.500
Model-neutral.

V25-41
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.800
Shared by people and agents.

V26-42
00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:34.600
NavisLabs.

V26-43
00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:37.600
The shared understanding for your organization.

